{"title":"Career Roadmap · Junior Business Analyst","role":"Junior Business Analyst","summary":"A Junior Business Analyst (BA) connects business requirements, users, processes and technology teams.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Computer Applications"},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Very Strong"},{"label":"Typical Entry Level","text":"Junior Business Analyst / Business Analyst Trainee / Business Analyst Associate"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Junior Business Analyst (BA) connects business requirements, users, processes and technology teams."},{"type":"p","text":"The role involves understanding a business problem, gathering requirements, analysing data and processes, documenting what the system should do, and helping technical teams deliver the right solution."},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Com Computer Applications, this is a strong interdisciplinary career because the degree combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commerce","Business","Accounting","Computer Applications"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"That combination is particularly useful for business analysis in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Accounting/ERP"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"EdTech"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Role","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business/Technology Intern"},{"text":"Business & IT fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Data/Business Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Excel + process analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"BA Intern / Project Intern"},{"text":"Requirements & SQL"}],[{"text":"Graduation"},{"text":"Junior Business Analyst"},{"text":"Requirements + analysis"}],[{"text":"2–4 Years"},{"text":"